[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://unitlabelthemenorm"]

; A Theme gives Label a `normal` box with a different margin on each side (label.cpp:141-142,472-512,591-616,757-775,983).
; The box draws under the text, adds its minimum size in a container, narrows the wrap width, and offsets the
; lines: left and right alignment take a margin and centring takes none. HeaderSmall is a Label variation, so it
; finds the same box. The Theme is the one variable.

